---
import DiagramIcon from '../../mdx/DiagramIcon.astro';
// Set 07: the limit-up loop made visible by HOSE's ±7% daily price band.
// Millions of shares queued to buy at the ceiling while sellers hold out,
// expecting the run to continue (Vietnamese financial press; MoneyF).
const buyRows = [
  { y: 136, w: 420 },
  { y: 164, w: 380 },
  { y: 192, w: 396 },
  { y: 220, w: 408 },
];
---
<div class="qcq">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 452" role="img" aria-hidden="true">
    <DiagramIcon name="bell" x={22} y={20} size={22} />
    <text x="44" y="25" class="qcq-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>An order book at the ceiling</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Một sổ lệnh ở giá trần</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="44" y="46" class="qcq-muted">
      <tspan data-lang-en>HOSE's rule allows at most +7% per session. The stock has just touched it.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Quy định của HOSE cho phép tăng tối đa +7% mỗi phiên. Cổ phiếu vừa chạm trần.</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="150" y="86" text-anchor="middle" class="qcq-col">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Sell side</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Bên bán</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="430" y="86" text-anchor="middle" class="qcq-col">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Buy side</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Bên mua</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="40" y="100" width="220" height="176" rx="10" class="qcq-panel" />
    <text x="150" y="150" text-anchor="middle" class="qcq-empty">
      <tspan data-lang-en>no sellers</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>không có người bán</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="150" y="176" text-anchor="middle" class="qcq-muted">
      <tspan data-lang-en>they hold out, expecting</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>họ giữ hàng, chờ đà</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="150" y="194" text-anchor="middle" class="qcq-muted">
      <tspan data-lang-en>the run to continue</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>tăng sẽ tiếp tục</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="320" y="100" width="220" height="176" rx="10" class="qcq-panel" />
    {buyRows.map((r) => <rect x="340" y={r.y} width={r.w * 0.48} height="20" rx="3" class="qcq-buybar" />)}
    <text x="430" y="122" text-anchor="middle" class="qcq-buy">
      <tspan data-lang-en>millions of shares queued</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>hàng triệu cổ phiếu dư mua</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="40" x2="540" y1="290" y2="290" class="qcq-ceiling" />
    <text x="540" y="312" text-anchor="end" class="qcq-ceiling-label">
      <tspan data-lang-en>+7% ceiling — today's maximum</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Giá trần +7% — mức tối đa hôm nay</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="330" width="540" height="102" rx="10" class="qcq-note" />
    <text x="36" y="356" class="qcq-strong">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Almost nothing trades. Everyone is on one side at one price.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Gần như không khớp được gì. Mọi người cùng ở một phía, một mức giá.</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="380" class="qcq-bad">
      <tspan data-lang-en>The queue is reflexivity: buyers buying because others are buying.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Chính hàng đợi đó là reflexivity: mua vì thấy người khác mua.</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="404" class="qcq-muted">
      <tspan data-lang-en>When the loop breaks, the same crowd is on one side going down — margin calls.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Khi vòng lặp gãy, cùng đám đông đó lại đứng một phía đi xuống — call margin.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qcq {
    margin: 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .qcq svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .qcq text {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    fill: var(--text-body);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .qcq .qcq-h {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .qcq .qcq-col {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .qcq .qcq-muted {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .qcq-panel {
    fill: var(--bg-alt);
    stroke: var(--border);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .qcq .qcq-empty {
    fill: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .qcq-buybar {
    fill: var(--red);
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
  .qcq .qcq-buy,
  .qcq .qcq-bad {
    fill: var(--red);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }
  .qcq-ceiling {
    stroke: var(--text);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    stroke-dasharray: 7 5;
  }
  .qcq .qcq-ceiling-label {
    fill: var(--text);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }
  .qcq .qcq-strong {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .qcq-note {
    fill: var(--bg-alt);
    stroke: var(--border);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
</style>
